⚡️🇺🇸 A U.S. Black Hawk UH-60 helicopter from the 160th Special Operations Aviation Regiment crashed in the Colorado foothills during a training operation.

Four people were aboard, with no injuries reported. The U.S. Army described the incident as an “aviation mishap” and has launched an investigation.

