⚡🇮🇱🇳🇱 Israel Expels Dutch representatives from the Gaza aid coordination center in Kiryat Gat, ordering them to leave within one week after the Netherlands adopted a law banning trade in goods from Israeli settlements.

Foreign Minister Gideon Sa’ar said the move was a response to what Israel considers anti-Israel policies, while Washington was notified in advance.

